{"id":28948,"slug":"pan-s-labyrinth","title":"Pan’s Labyrinth","year":2006,"country":"Spain","duration":119,"spine":838,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28948-pan-s-labyrinth","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/dc6376f090e305a122db1a855a025892/5i7NGnwsubXRYF6luLdSi6iC9ICn5O_large.jpg","description":"An Academy Award–winning dark fable set five years after the end of the Spanish Civil War, Pan’s Labyrinth encapsulates the rich visual style and genre-defying craft of Guillermo del Toro. Eleven-year-old Ofelia (Ivana Baquero, in a mature and tender performance) comes face to face with the horrors of fascism when she and her pregnant mother are uprooted to the countryside, where her new stepfather (Sergi López), a sadistic captain in General Francisco Franco’s army, hunts down Republican guerrillas refusing to give up the fight. The violent reality in which Ofelia lives merges seamlessly with her fantastical interior world when she meets a faun in a decaying labyrinth and is set on a strange, mythic journey that is at once terrifying and beautiful. In his revisiting of this bloody period in Spanish history, del Toro creates a vivid depiction of the monstrosities of war infiltrating a child’s imagination and threatening the innocence of youth.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Guillermo del Toro","slug":"guillermo-del-toro"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ivana Baquero","role":"Ofelia","slug":"ivana-baquero"},{"actor":"Sergi López","role":"Vidal","slug":"sergi-lopez"},{"actor":"Maribel Verdú","role":"Mercedes","slug":"maribel-verdu"},{"actor":"Doug Jones","role":"The faun/The Pale Man","slug":"doug-jones"},{"actor":"Álex Angulo","role":"Doctor Ferreiro","slug":"alex-angulo"},{"actor":"Ariadna Gil","role":"Carmen","slug":"ariadna-gil"},{"actor":"Manolo Solo","role":"Garcés","slug":"manolo-solo"},{"actor":"César Vea","role":"Serrano","slug":"cesar-vea"},{"actor":"Roger Casamajor","role":"Pedro","slug":"roger-casamajor"},{"actor":"Ivan Massagué","role":"El Tarta","slug":"ivan-massague"},{"actor":"Gonzalo Uriarte","role":"Francés","slug":"gonzalo-uriarte"},{"actor":"Eusebio Lázaro","role":"Padre","slug":"eusebio-lazaro"},{"actor":"Paco Vidal","role":"Sacerdote","slug":"paco-vidal"},{"actor":"Federico Luppi","role":"Rey","slug":"federico-luppi"},{"actor":"Pablo Adán","role":"Narrator/Voice of the faun","slug":"pablo-adan"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Guillermo del Toro","slug":"guillermo-del-toro"},{"role":"Written and produced by","person":"Guillermo del Toro","slug":"guillermo-del-toro"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Bertha Navarro","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Alfonso Cuarón","slug":"alfonso-cuaron"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Frida Torresblanco","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Alvaro Augustin","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producers","person":"Belen Atienza","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Elena Manrique","slug":null},{"role":"Director of photography","person":"Guillermo Navarro","slug":null},{"role":"Edited by","person":"Bernat Vilaplana","slug":null},{"role":"Production design by","person":"Eugenio Caballero","slug":null},{"role":"Music by","person":"Javier Navarrete","slug":null},{"role":"Sound designer","person":"Martín Hernández","slug":null},{"role":"Sound by","person":"Miguel Polo","slug":null},{"role":"Makeup effects and animatronics","person":"DDT Efectos Especiales","slug":null},{"role":"Visual effects by","person":"CafeFX, Inc.","slug":null},{"role":"Special effects supervisor","person":"Reyes Abades","slug":null},{"role":"Costume design by","person":"Lala Huete","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[{"session":957,"title":"Oscar Isaac’s Closet Picks","date":"2026-04-16","video":"https://vimeo.com/1187839973","celebs":[{"id":10,"name":"Oscar Isaac"}]},{"session":443,"title":"Five Comics’ Closet Picks","date":"2019-01-24","video":"https://vimeo.com/314876838","celebs":[{"id":333,"name":"Five Comics’ Closet Picks"}]},{"session":440,"t